. * pkg_programs.do -- helper programs of the replication package (loaded by 00
> _config.do).
. * pkg_py <arguments>: runs the package's Python interpreter (${PYTHON}, set f
> rom PKG_PYTHON by run_all.py)
. * with the rest of the line passed verbatim to the operating system shell ([D
> ] shell).
. * POSIX: the line is  "<python>" <arguments> . Windows: cmd /c removes the ou
> termost pair of double quotes
. * when a line starts with a quote, so the whole line is wrapped in one extra 
> pair (char(34)).
